## Notes: ZacUI consumable bars: flasks, elixirs, food and jujus, potions, weapon stones and oils - one click each. Readycheck's consumables, potion and weapon bars, ZacUI's way.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.8
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
