## X-ZacUI-Part: Consumables

# Part of ZacUI. Shares ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by
# Core_Boot) and its saved variables (ZacUIDB.consbars, a profile
# section; each bar's spot is its mover's, ZacUIDB.movers.consbars_<bar>).
# Every bar is off until turned on. Readycheck keeps its own bars; the
# page copies their settings over and can switch Readycheck's off.

